This Terraform program creates an Elastic Beanstalk application with an app version lifecycle, retaining the version for 5 days. It includes an IAM role for Elastic Beanstalk, an S3 bucket for storing application versions, an S3 object containing the application version zip file, and an Elastic Beanstalk application. The app version lifecycle is configured to retain the version for 5 days.

